# subalpine_fir_far: a far fir standing out of a treeline across the water
# (BUILD_PLAN S5 brief B5; doc 11.1), drawn for the wide pixel (each pixel
# about 1.75 times wider than tall, 11.2): a spire one pixel wide at the
# top, two below it, widening only near its foot, so it reads as the
# narrow subalpine fir and not a triangle. Shadow side spruce (11) on the
# left, lit side forest (12) on the right. No trunk: its foot stands in
# the treeline, and a far trunk is only a brown dot. The anchor, 0,0, is
# its foot, at the middle. 5 wide, 12 tall.
C 11  L 0,-11 0,0  L -1,-7  L -1,-5 -1,0  L -2,-2 -2,0
C 12  L 1,-9 1,0  L 2,-4  L 2,-2 2,0
